## Gemini API Compose Starter - Local Configuration Template
##
## Copy this file or add the following line to your `local.properties` file:
##
##   GEMINI_API_KEY=YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY_HERE
##
## Note:
## - Never commit `local.properties` to version control (it is ignored by .gitignore).
## - Alternatively, you can set the `GEMINI_API_KEY` environment variable in your shell or CI/CD environment.
## - The application gracefully handles a missing API key without crashing.

GEMINI_API_KEY=YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY_HERE
